<title>USA: VISX Inc Q3 turns to profit.</title>
<headline>VISX Inc Q3 turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   9/30/96  9/30/95  9/30/96  9/30/95</p>
<p> Product sales		  $14,484 $ 2,800  $39,385  $ 7,280</p>
<p> Service and other revenues   5,183   1,151   11,391    3,146</p>
<p>    Total revenues	     19,667   3,951   50,776   10,426</p>
<p> Cost of revenues		 7,662   2,702   21,904    7,140</p>
<p> Income (loss) from opers     4,933  (2,557)   9,199  (9,044)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)	   5,613  (2,378)  11,443  (10,657)</p>
<p>    Net income EPS		 0.35  (0.20)     0.72   (0.90)</p>
<p>    Wgtd avg shrs		15,840  12,156   15,988   11,823</p>
<p>			  (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 9 months ended Sept 30 1995 loss includes a charge in the second quarter of $2,250,000 (pretax), or $0.19 per share, related to the settlement of a securities class action lawsuit against the Company.</p>
</text>
